  "details": "Looks can lock up and won't be equippable. Resulting in nothing happening if you try to select it from the circle menu. Or saying \"Error wearing look\" from the looks menu.\n\nI was still able to edit the look without any problems.\n\n2026.04.29 14:59:25 Error      -  [AvatarBuilder] Failed to equip look: System.Exception: Item inv_09240dc8-92d3-43cb-9a43-d78ced1c79f0 cannot be equipped in slot wear.\n\nThe problem resolved itself after restarting the client.\n\nCan't reproduce right now. But will update with more info if I figure it out.",
